# OCTO 1.0 GitHub Edition is a static Bring Your Own Key frontend.
# No backend environment variables and no deployment secrets are required.
# Do NOT put a Gemini API key in this file, in code, or in a commit.
# The user enters their own key in the app Settings screen. It is kept in
# application memory only and is cleared when the session ends or the user
# disconnects. It is never stored in LocalStorage or IndexedDB by default.
#
# Optional public model id only, not a secret:
# VITE_GEMINI_DEFAULT_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash
